One could try and guess scroll types by checking frequencies - the
most frequent scroll that's never used by monsters often is the
identify scroll. Scrolls of teleportation, create monster and earth
may be used by monsters, and scrolls of scare monster can be
identified by their effect when lying on the floor or when they
crumble when picked up.

And scrolls can be price-IDd by _any_ shopkeeper - just throw them
into the shop from outside the shop proper (i think you can stand in
the doorway) and they become property of the shopkeeper; then you just
buy them "back". A bit costly, and one should take care not to
accidentally throw a scroll directly at the shopkeeper.

